// Title: Ping Hex IP
// ID: 1a0d4aba-7668-4365-9ce4-6d79ab088dfd
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2018-03-23
// Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1140, attack.t1027
// Description: Detects a ping command that uses a hex encoded IP address
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (process.executable endswith "\\ping.exe" and process.command_line regex "0x[a-fA-F0-9]{8}")
